JkFlow 1.00 Wine PS4 runtime: orbis-win 9749fcd local edits (build scripts)

The untracked prospero-win link in this checkout points to the prospero-win checkout; it is not a file.
scripts/sync-toolchain.sh has one more local edit, its hard-coded ROOT line made relative; it is
applied with the sed command in patches/series.txt because the removed line holds a build-host path.

 scripts/build-app-ps4.sh
 scripts/native245-resume-reloc.sh
---
